S", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Bloopers multiplayer lobby.png", "id": "1105551165505709", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_1105551172172375_2114836483273602969_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZyUZDZd0yvwQ7kNvwH4areY&_nc_oc=AdoPJPgCqgsWoDNbBiaZ5ISd0WuktJMNKd5kLVhSTpcgoBJ5aX54WfZJu7fkMmpEQMw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSwUaUcUzSX9z0XLT7vCiNWQrRdFYiXh-HNIcQZ1Sap9A&oe=6AF47AE9"}, {"file_name": "ClassicLevel1players.png", "id": "1964580971557239", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628411_1964580978223905_8195160644881487430_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mLWPbhrU1J8Q7kNvwFLyKlj&_nc_oc=AdqPZzJbjV1PXOWtJzsfXKGOGg9A320TIlCulnQHCpde6PEZF9b4ZIMBN39vqepG8bM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRnbRyKgF9XxPc7JIm5FsYc_OQ2XCbANjBlN54YIVhjhQ&oe=6AF48D1C"}, {"file_name": "UnderwaterLevel1.png", "id": "1492913799348089", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628447_1492913802681422_3603945301372072065_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4OAfjJ7AQq0Q7kNvwFEX24T&_nc_oc=Adq1Z5lXkaZ_H2u8jRU-BeGa4ggF7bsAKuWGPl27v_-t90XRN5oXerHcRogZFdvloGs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8eJ1m7ra2fVR1Xw7efg1Cqa4lhC4SDcfQzVd9CDRBgA&oe=6AF47A3C"}, {"file_name": "UnderwaterLevel1players3.png", "id": "1484903320161106", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593858738_1484903323494439_3927866950523508663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a7ToNi1lWWIQ7kNvwG9iwaG&_nc_oc=AdoTmySm_WVZMkInBsqJFhWBoCaFsM_6NFlY8EbXAaQ66lm8299pMv8faU919tQYt_o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXAkK_6XGwgvxLqpyx5K0Galj34YzmwU9olaGNGF01PA&oe=6AF48F79"}, {"file_name": "ClassicLevel1players2.png", "id": "4666897716913378", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628446_4666897720246711_271661554039611454_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vFJZgWNP9wAQ7kNvwEdMwM1&_nc_oc=AdpnHgiCtV3pPx5DnPhOb4slyl_z5wedIxHbfcCit8Ck_iFbpLHKZXWzsWXrkbYClsY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSvouQKjcxPF17hAkwi9NkSaGUNoN7u1KkaiYbLV8_vPg&oe=6AF47E22"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BLOOPERS", "keywords": ["party", "Obstacle", "battle", "funny", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Race. Jump. Fall. Laugh. Repeat! \ud83d\ude02\n\nWelcome to BLOOPERS! You're a wobbly bean racing through crazy obstacle courses. Jump over gaps, dodge silly traps, and race your friends to the finish line!\n\n**Up to 10 players. Tons of chaos. Endless laughs!**\n\n\n# \ud83c\udfc6 RACE TO THE FINAL!\n\nCan you survive all 3 rounds?\n\n- **Round 1:** Race fast! Only half the players qualify.\n- **Round 2:** Dodge obstacles and make it to the final!\n- **Round 3:** Go for the win! Only one Blooper becomes the champion!\n\nOops, you fell? No worries! Respawn and keep racing!\n\n# \ud83c\udfae PLAY YOUR WAY!\n\n- **Quick Match:** Jump into a race with random players.\n- **Private Match:** Host a match and race with your friends.\n- **Solo Practice:** Practice your jumps and master the courses.\n\n**Ready, set, WOBBLE! \ud83c\udf89**", "short_description": "VR obstacle battle game where you race, dodge and survive hilarious challenges with friends!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rangesh06.github.io/bloopers-vr-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Spawn Bridge", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://rangeshxr.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_i