.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRVaiFrpZ81JjfC787lZN4YBXwDLELNnknQZ_P1vj6iWg&oe=6AF4A41B"}, {"file_name": "com.Bloopers.BloopersVR-20260925-225342.png", "id": "1387943301065678", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619404_1387943304399011_1549951615576152691_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sIfT5T01wBsQ7kNvwHWWUqF&_nc_oc=AdqwspneIrjiPygaR7L1idh2PlsOPKz9hx60zWpYyKaX2D-rik8W5-5MZJIDCEmH9c0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTEwoBOGzw71SUwNqOoL1EYNdTM4eQ9KNFUcL4-sjNHXQ&oe=6AF476EE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bloopers", "keywords": ["party", "Obstacle", "battle", "funny", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Bloopers VR \n---\n**Welcome to the wobble! Race, trip, bounce, laugh, repeat.**\n\nBloopers is a chaotic VR obstacle battle where YOU are the wobbly bean. Grab up to 9 friends, dodge ridiculous hazards, and sprint for the finish. Winning is great. Wiping out hilariously is almost as good.\n\nNo guns. No gore. Just playground chaos in VR.\n\n**HOW IT WORKS**\n---\nRound 1: Big, wide and messy. Half qualify.\n---\nRound 2: Tighter paths, trickier timing.\n---\nRound 3: Full sprint for the crown. One winner dances.\n\nFall off? Back in 3 seconds. Knocked out? Jump straight into the next match \u2014 no lobby jail.\n\n**WHY YOU'LL LOVE IT**\n* Your body is the controller. Lean, dodge, run, jump\n* 2 worlds, 6 courses. Bright Classic + bubbly Underwater\n* Party your way. Quick Match, Public or private code (3-10 players)\n* Solo Practice offline + mirror Dressing Room to style your Blooper\n* Fair cosmetics only, comfort-first VR, proximity chat with mute/block/report\n\nBuilt for 20-minute bursts of laughter. Strap in, pick your Blooper, and try not to blooper it up!\n\n**See you at the finish line. **\n", "short_description": "VR obstacle battle game where you race, dodge, and survive hilarious challenges with friends!"}]}, "developer_name